{"id":"621e8d7c1c15f553","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-variety.md","title":"Variety","display":"df-variety — Variety","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-variety","aliases":["58-df-variety","Variety"],"display":"df-variety — Variety","depends_on":["[[58-df-algebraic-set]]","[[58-df-field]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-variety"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-variety</span><span>Variety</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-variety — Variety"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"71b29ecf4e6d3eb0\" href=\"?note=71b29ecf4e6d3eb0\" title=\"58-df-algebraic-set\">58-df-algebraic-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\in V\">\\(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\in V\\)</span> (a chosen field structure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\)</span> (field predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AlgSet}_{k,n}(X;+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\">\\(\\mathrm{AlgSet}_{k,n}(X;+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\)</span> (affine-algebraic-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"71b29ecf4e6d3eb0\" href=\"?note=71b29ecf4e6d3eb0\" title=\"58-df-algebraic-set\">58-df-algebraic-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S\\)</span> (irreducible affine-variety predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}affine\\text{-}variety} \\vdash \\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S(X;k,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{AlgSet}_{k,n}(X;+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\forall Y,Z\\subseteq k^n\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{AlgSet}_{k,n}(Y;+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{AlgSet}_{k,n}(Z;+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land X=Y\\cup Z\\to(X=Y\\lor X=Z)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}affine\\text{-}variety} \\vdash \\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S(X;k,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{AlgSet}_{k,n}(X;+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\forall Y,Z\\subseteq k^n\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{AlgSet}_{k,n}(Y;+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{AlgSet}_{k,n}(Z;+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land X=Y\\cup Z\\to(X=Y\\lor X=Z)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}affine\\text{-}variety\\text{-}compatibility} \\vdash \\operatorname{Variety}_k(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\in V\\;\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S(X;k,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}affine\\text{-}variety\\text{-}compatibility} \\vdash \\operatorname{Variety}_k(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\in V\\;\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S(X;k,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom uses “affine variety” for an irreducible affine algebraic set over a designated field structure; some authors allow reducible varieties.</li>\n<li>The former dependency named <code>irreducible</code> defined irreducible ring elements, not irreducible algebraic sets, so irreducibility is expanded here by the union criterion.</li>\n<li>Coordinatization: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k[X]=k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]/I_k(X)\">\\(k[X]=k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]/I_k(X)\\)</span> is the coordinate ring.</li>\n<li>For irreducible <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dim X=\\operatorname{trdeg}_k k(X)\">\\(\\dim X=\\operatorname{trdeg}_k k(X)\\)</span>; in general the coordinate ring's Krull dimension is used.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hartshorne, Algebraic Geometry</li>\n<li>Harris, Algebraic Geometry</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-algebraic-set","status":"resolved","id":"71b29ecf4e6d3eb0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-algebraic-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-field]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)$ (field predicate, see [[58-df-field]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-algebraic-set","status":"resolved","id":"71b29ecf4e6d3eb0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AlgSet}_{k,n}(X;+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)$ (affine-algebraic-set predicate, see [[58-df-algebraic-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AlgSet}_{k,n}(X;+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}affine\\text{-}variety} \\vdash \\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S(X;k,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{AlgSet}_{k,n}(X;+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\forall Y,Z\\subseteq k^n\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{AlgSet}_{k,n}(Y;+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{AlgSet}_{k,n}(Z;+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land X=Y\\cup Z\\to(X=Y\\lor X=Z)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}affine\\text{-}variety\\text{-}compatibility} \\vdash \\operatorname{Variety}_k(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\in V\\;\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S(X;k,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)","display":true},{"tex":"k[X]=k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]/I_k(X)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\dim X=\\operatorname{trdeg}_k k(X)","display":false}],"bytes":1881,"backlinks":[{"id":"07ee726a6e15b274","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S$ (structured affine-variety predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-variety.md]])"},{"id":"873303ae0d44ae55","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"53a60793a214598a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S(X;k_0,n,+_0,\\cdot_0,0_0,1_0)$ (exact affine-variety signature, see [[58-df-variety]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1364","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-variety.md|58-df-variety]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["71b29ecf4e6d3eb0","1eb4a89b005d9cda"]}